          abs_of_nonneg (inv_nonneg.mpr (norm_nonneg _)),
          inv_mul_cancel₀ (norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr x.2)]⟩ : Sphere n) :=
    Continuous.subtype_mk hf _
  exact hg.congr (fun x => (diskDirection_of_ne n x.1 x.2).symm)
```
