Let me write the full theorem statement:

```lean
theorem sphereOfTwoDisks (n : ℕ) {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] [CompactSpace X] [T2Space X]
    (A B : Set X) (hA : IsClosed A) (hB : IsClosed B) (hcover : A ∪ B = univ)
    (eA : A ≃ₜ Disk (n + 1)) (eB : B ≃ₜ Disk (n + 1)) (h : Sphere n ≃ₜ Sphere n)
    (hbdA : ∀ x (hx : x ∈ A),
      (((eA ⟨x, hx⟩ : Disk (n + 1)) : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin (n + 1))) ∈ Sphere n ↔ x ∈ B))
    (hbdB : ∀ x (hx : x ∈ B),
      (((eB ⟨x, hx⟩ : Disk (n + 1)) : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin (n + 1))) ∈ Sphere n ↔ x ∈ A))
    (hcompat : ∀ x (hxA : x ∈ A) (hxB : x ∈ B),
      eB ⟨x, hxB⟩ = sphereToDisk n (h ⟨eA ⟨x, hxA⟩,
        (hbdA x hxA).mpr hxB⟩))
    : X ≃ₜ Sphere (n + 1)
```

Proof:
1. `q : X → DiskGlueQuot n h`:
```lean
let q : X → DiskGlueQuot n h := fun x =>
  if hx : x ∈ A then Quot.mk _ (Sum.inl (eA ⟨x, hx⟩))
  else Quot.mk _ (Sum.inr (eB ⟨x, (hcover ▸ Set.mem_univ x : x ∈ A ∪ B).resolve_left hx⟩))
```
2. `Continuous q`:
```lean
have hq : Continuous q := by
  rw [← continuousOn_univ, ← hcover]
  rw [continuousOn_union_iff_of_isClosed hA hB]
  constructor
  · -- on A
    rw [continuousOn_iff_continuous_domRestrict]
    have hcont : Continuous fun x : A => Quot.mk (diskGlueRel n h) (Sum.inl (eA x)) :=
