## Honest remaining blockers (not claimed)
Moise triangulation of arbitrary 3-manifolds (node 1), Whitehead smoothing (node 2), and Ricci-flow finite extinction (node 3) remain **separate, unproved** tasks; van Kampen for connected sums (node 6b) is no longer needed for `π₁(S³)=0`. The next concrete optional subproblem recorded is a bundled finite abstract simplicial complex with `|K₁ ∪ K₂| ≅ |K₁| ∪_{|K₁∩K₂|} |K₂|`, for which the closed-cover theorem is exactly the topological input.
